            <div style={{ fontFamily: "'Montserrat', sans-serif", fontSize: "12px", color: "#5a5068", marginBottom: "28px", lineHeight: 1.6 }}>High-performing post structures and ready-to-use content adapted for your voice. Click any card to expand, copy the post, or generate a fresh variation.</div>
