            </div>
            <div style={{ fontFamily: mono, fontSize: "12px", fontWeight: 300, color: "#4a3e5a", marginBottom: "30px", lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
              High-performing post structures adapted for your voice. Expand any card to copy the full post or generate a fresh variation.
            </div>
            {SWIPE_FILE.map(function(item) {
